This looks like a Caesar salad with romaine lettuce, a dressing coating, and possibly a crouton or cheese. The plate is a square shape of about 24 cm, and the salad occupies a small portion of it, roughly 10 x 8 cm, with one separate piece at the top.

Estimated mass is about 80 g of lettuce with dressing. Caesar dressing is calorie-dense, so lettuce at about 15 kcal per 100 g plus roughly 1.5 tablespoons of dressing (about 100 kcal) gives about 120 kcal. Allowing a little for cheese and croutons brings the total to around 130 kcal.

